                content: `
                    <h2 class="edit_header1" style="">Fitting Your Data To This Template</h2>
                    <p>The "Rad Read Template 1" CSV file will contain just a header row with one attribute in each column header. When fitting your data to this template, you can either reorder your own data to fit this format, or you can reorder the column headers to fit your data. </p>
